AN USERS IS TRANSFERRED TO AND REMAINS IN THE UNITED STATES.MICROSOFT- DISCUSSIONS ARE PRELIMINARY AND THERE CAN BE NO ASSURANCE THAT A TRANSACTION WHICH INVOLVES MICROSOFT WILL PROCEED.'}{'symbol': 'MSI', 'date': '2020-08-03 13:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Motorola Solutions Acquires Global Video Security Solutions Provider Pelco', 'text': 'MOTOROLA SOLUTIONS ACQUIRES GLOBAL VIDEO SECURITY SOLUTIONS PROVIDER PELCO FOR $110M IN CASH, CONTINUING INVESTMENT IN VIDEO SECURITY & ANALYTICS.'}{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2020-08-03 14:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Georgia Power Prepares For Tropical Storm Isaias', 'text': 'Georgia Power:  :GEORGIA POWER PREPARES FOR TROPICAL STORM ISAIAS.GEORGIA POWER'}{'symbol': 'TGT', 'date': '2020-08-03 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Wellcare Announces Partnership With Shipt', 'text': 'WELLCARE ANNOUNCES PARTNERSHIP WITH SHIPT.'}{'symbol': 'TSN', 'date': '2020-08-03 13:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Tyson Foods Names Dean Banks To Succeed Noel White As Chief Executive Officer', 'text': "TYSON FOODS NAMES DEAN BANKS TO SUCCEED NOEL WHITE AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER ON OCTOBER 3, 2020.TYSON FOODS INC - BANKS IS CURRENTLY PRESIDENT AND A NON-INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR; WHITE ELEVATED TO ROLE ON BOARD AS EXECUTIVE VICE CHAIRMAN.TYSON FOODS INC - BANKS' EXPANDED ROLE OF CEO IS PART OF BOARD'S DELIBERATE, LONG-TERM SUCCESSION PLANNING.."}{'symbol': 'TSN', 'date': '2020-08-03 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Tyson Foods Reports Quarterly Adjusted EPS Of $1.40', 'text': 'TYSON FOODS REPORTS THIRD QUARTER 2020 RESULTS.QTRLY GAAP EPS OF $1.44.QTRLY SALES $10.02 BILLION VERSUS $10.89 BILLION REPORTED LAST YEAR.QTRLY ADJUSTED EPS OF $1.40.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $0.94, REVENUE VIEW $10.56 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.QTRLY RESULTS NEGATIVELY IMPACTED BY APPROXIMATELY $340 MILLION OF DIRECT INCREMENTAL EXPENSES RELATED TO COVID-19.USDA PROJECTS PORK DOMESTIC PRODUCTION WILL INCREASE ABOUT 1% IN 2021 VERSUS A COVID-19 IMPACTED FISCAL 2020.DELIVERED STRONG RESULTS DURING Q3 LED BY STRENGTH IN OUR BEEF AND PORK SEGMENTS.FOR FISCAL 2021, EXPECT AMPLE SUPPLIES FOR BEEF IN REGIONS WHERE CO OPERATES PLANTS.FOR FISCAL 2020, EXPECT CAPITAL EXPENDITURES TO BE ABOUT $1.2 BILLION WITH A SIMILAR AMOUNT EXPECTED IN 2021.EXPECT TOTAL LIQUIDITY, WHICH WAS ABOUT $3.1 BILLION AT JUNE 27, 2020, TO REMAIN ABOVE MINIMUM LIQUIDITY TARGET OF $1.0 BILLION.NOT CURRENTLY PROVIDING SEGMENT ADJUSTED OPERATING MARGIN GUIDANCE.COVID-19 CHALLENGES ANTICIPATED TO INCREASE OPERATING COSTS & NEGATIVELY IMPACT VOLUMES FOR REMAINDER OF 2020 AND INTO 2021.TYSON - PORK SALES VOLUME DECREASED IN Q3 PRIMARILY DUE TO LOWER PRODUCTION THROUGHPUT ASSOCIATED WITH COVID-19.EXPECT DECREASES IN VOLUMES IN LAST QUARTER OF 2020 IN CHICKEN & PREPARED FOODS SEGMENTS.WITHIN EACH SEGMENT, ABSORBED HIGHER-THAN-NORMAL OPERATING COSTS RELATED TO COVID-19 IN QUARTER.'}{'symbol': 'WMT', 'date': '2020-08-03 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Beyond Meat Expands Club Store Distribution With BJ's Wholesale & Sam's Club", 'text': "BEYOND MEAT EXPANDS CLUB STORE DISTRIBUTION WITH BJ'S WHOLESALE AND SAM'S CLUB."}